Package: xios-sdl2
Version: @DEB_SDL2_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.libsdl.org/
Depends: libwayland0, libxkbcommon0, angle, libpulse0
Description: Private SDL2 runtime for Xios Wayland games
 SDL2 built as a native iOS/Darwin library with the Wayland video backend,
 OpenGL ES through Xios ANGLE, touch and desktop input through iosc, and
 PulseAudio output. Cocoa and UIKit window backends are intentionally disabled.
 .
 This deliberately does NOT provide libsdl2-2.0-0. With the UIKit backend off
 it exports none of _SDL_UIKitRunApp or
 _SDL_OnApplicationDidChangeStatusBarOrientation, which Procursus's SDL2
 exports and its dependents (ffmpeg, libavdevice59, and powder, a UIKit SDL
 app) may import. It therefore installs into /var/jb/usr/lib/xios-sdl2 and is
 reached only by programs that ask for it on DYLD_LIBRARY_PATH, leaving the
 system SDL2 untouched.
